msgstr "下载中"

msgid "Download canceled"
msgstr "下载已取消"

msgid "Download failed"
msgstr "下载失败"

msgid "Upgrade firmware On the Air"
msgstr "在线升级固件"

msgid "Check and upgrade firmware from the Internet"
msgstr "通过网络检查和更新固件"

msgid "The latest firmware"
msgstr "最新固件"

msgid "The image file does not contain a supported format. Maybe try again later."
msgstr "镜像文件格式不支持或损坏。也许稍候再试试"

msgid "History Log"
msgstr "历史更新日志"

msgid "Found downloading firmware, will show progress"
msgstr "发现下载中的固件，将显示当前进度"

msgid "Use IPv4 network for OTA operations"
msgstr "使用 IPv4 连接 OTA 服务器"

msgid "Check and upgrade from this fork's GitHub Releases (not official koolcenter). Checksum required; flash only after you confirm."
msgstr "从本裁剪版的 GitHub Releases 检查和下载固件。固件须通过校验，并由你确认后才会刷写。"

msgid "Step 1/3: Check update"
msgstr "第 1/3 步：检查更新"

msgid "Step 2/3: Download firmware"
msgstr "第 2/3 步：下载固件"

msgid "Step 3/3: Flash image"
msgstr "第 3/3 步：刷写固件"

msgid "Download progress"
msgstr "下载进度"

msgid "Verifying SHA256..."
msgstr "正在校验 SHA256..."

msgid "Decompressing..."
msgstr "正在解压..."

msgid "Preparing download..."
msgstr "正在准备下载..."

msgid "Checksum failed"
msgstr "固件校验失败"

msgid "Decompression failed"
msgstr "固件解压失败"

msgid "Network error or download interrupted"
msgstr "网络错误或下载中断"

msgid "Firmware downloaded (SHA256 verified)"
msgstr "固件已下载（SHA256 校验通过）"

msgid "manual confirm only, never automatic"
msgstr "需手动确认，不会自动刷写"

msgid "Keep settings and retain the current configuration"
msgstr "保留当前配置"

msgid "Flash the downloaded image now? A curated config backup runs first (soft-fail if disk full). Do not power off during upgrade."
msgstr "现在刷写已下载的固件？刷写前会尝试备份重要配置（磁盘空间不足时跳过备份）。升级期间请勿断电。"

msgid "OTA Configuration"
msgstr "在线升级配置"

msgid "This build upgrades from GitHub Releases of the trimmed fork (not official koolcenter images)."
msgstr "本固件从裁剪版的 GitHub Releases 更新。"

msgid "GitHub Release source"
msgstr "GitHub Release 来源"

msgid "Owner"
msgstr "仓库所有者"

msgid "Repository"
msgstr "仓库名称"

msgid "Asset name suffix"
msgstr "固件文件名后缀"

msgid "Default: squashfs-combined-efi.img.gz (GPT/EFI). Use squashfs-combined.img.gz for legacy MBR if needed."
msgstr "默认：squashfs-combined-efi.img.gz（GPT/EFI）。旧式 MBR 系统可使用 squashfs-combined.img.gz。"

msgid "Pre-OTA config backup saved under /etc/istoreos-bak/."
msgstr "升级前配置备份已保存到 /etc/istoreos-bak/。"

msgid "Pre-OTA backup skipped or failed (disk full?) — flashing continues. See /tmp/istoreos-bak-ota.err"
msgstr "升级前备份已跳过或失败（磁盘空间不足？），仍会继续刷写。详情见 /tmp/istoreos-bak-ota.err。"

msgid ""
"If you are not automatically redirected to the login page in 2 minutes, "
"please try to manually entering the address or <a href='/'>click here</a> to refresh."
msgstr ""
"如果两分钟内没有自动重定向到登陆页面，请尝试手动输入地址或<a href='/'>点此</a>刷新。"

msgid "If the device has an LED status indicator, you can also check it."
msgstr "如果设备有状态指示灯也可查看它。"
